---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		
		<!-- SEO Meta Tags -->
		<title>Próximamente | Sitio en Construcción</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Estamos construyendo algo extraordinario. Nuestro nuevo sitio web estará disponible muy pronto." />
		<meta property="og:title" content="Próximamente | Sitio en Construcción" />
		<meta property="og:description" content="Estamos construyendo algo extraordinario. Nuestro nuevo sitio web estará disponible muy pronto." />
		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		
		<!-- Google Fonts: Public Sans -->
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Public+Sans:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	</head>

	<body class="bg-[#07070a] text-neutral-200 antialiased min-h-svh flex flex-col justify-between selection:bg-indigo-500/30 selection:text-indigo-200">
		<!-- Mesh Background with Ambient Gradients -->
		<div class="fixed inset-0 -z-10 bg-[#07070a] overflow-hidden">
			<!-- Glowing background blobs -->
			<div class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[60%] h-[60%] rounded-full bg-indigo-900/20 blur-[130px] mix-blend-screen animate-pulse-slow"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[50%] h-[50%] rounded-full bg-violet-900/10 blur-[120px] mix-blend-screen animate-pulse-slow" style="animation-delay: 1.5s;"></div>
			
			<!-- Grid overlay -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#ffffff03_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#ffffff03_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:3.5rem_3.5rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_50%,#000_60%,transparent_100%)]"></div>
		</div>

		<!-- Main Container -->
		<main class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center">
			
			<!-- Subtitle Badge with status indicator -->
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-900/80 border border-neutral-800/80 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-300 mb-8 backdrop-blur-md shadow-inner">
				<span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
					<span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
					<span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500"></span>
				</span>
				Diseño & Desarrollo Activo
			</div>

			<!-- Dynamic Orbital Icon -->
			<div class="relative w-24 h-24 mb-10 flex items-center justify-center">
				<!-- Core Glowing Node -->
				<div class="absolute w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(99,102,241,0.9)] animate-pulse"></div>
				<!-- Inner Orbital Ring -->
				<div class="absolute w-14 h-14 rounded-full border border-indigo-400/30 border-t-indigo-400/90 animate-orbit-ccw"></div>
				<!-- Outer Orbital Ring -->
				<div class="absolute w-24 h-24 rounded-full border border-dashed border-violet-500/20 border-r-violet-500/60 animate-orbit-cw"></div>
			</div>

			<!-- Heading Intro -->
			<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-neutral-100 to-neutral-500 mb-6 leading-[1.15]">
				Estamos construyendo<br class="hidden sm:inline"/>algo extraordinario
			</h1>
			<p class="text-neutral-400 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-lg mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed font-light">
				Nuestra nueva plataforma está en proceso de diseño y desarrollo. Muy pronto revelaremos un espacio digital único y sofisticado.
			</p>

			<!-- Project Phase Tracker -->
			<div class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto text-left mb-6">
				<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2.5">
					<span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Progreso del proyecto</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-indigo-500/20">15% Completado</span>
				</div>
				<div class="h-1.5 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800/80 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-6">
					<div class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-violet-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(99,102,241,0.4)]" style="width: 15%"></div>
				</div>
				
				<div class="space-y-3 bg-neutral-900/20 rounded-xl p-4 border border-neutral-800/20 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-xl">
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs py-1 border-b border-neutral-900/60">
						<span class="text-neutral-300 font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="relative flex h-2 w-2 ml-1 mr-1">
								<span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-indigo-400 opacity-75"></span>
								<span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-indigo-500"></span>
							</span>
							Concepto & Diseño de Interfaz
						</span>
						<span class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold bg-indigo-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px] border border-indigo-500/20 animate-pulse">En curso</span>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs py-1 border-b border-neutral-900/60">
						<span class="text-neutral-500 font-light flex items-center gap-2">
							<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-neutral-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
								<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.8 2.8a1 1 0 001.414-1.414L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
							</svg>
							Desarrollo del Sitio & Interactividad
						</span>
						<span class="text-neutral-500 font-semibold bg-neutral-950 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px] border border-neutral-800/80">Pendiente</span>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs py-1">
						<span class="text-neutral-500 font-light flex items-center gap-2">
							<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-neutral-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
								<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.8 2.8a1 1 0 001.414-1.414L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
							</svg>
							Carga de Contenido & Lanzamiento
						</span>
						<span class="text-neutral-500 font-semibold bg-neutral-950 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px] border border-neutral-800/80">Pendiente</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

		</main>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer class="w-full text-center py-8 px-6 border-t border-neutral-900/40 backdrop-blur-sm">
			<p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-neutral-600 font-light">&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Tu Marca. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>
